# Date words that alone take a more frequent non-date sense. A preposition,
# demonstrative, number or year beside the word keeps the date sense.
# mai: adverb "more, still, again" (Wiktionary "mai", Romanian, adverb).
# vară, vara: noun "female cousin" (Wiktionary "vară", Romanian, etymology 2):
# "vara mea". The season takes a preposition or a demonstrative: "la vară",
# "vara asta", "vara trecută".
mai
vară
vara
